{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is COCOBOY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>In an alternate history 2005</strong></u>, the forgotten 80's platformer COCOBOY has re-entered the public consciousness of a niche few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/hack.gif?t=1742402278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Modify, brute force, and restore</u></strong> unused game mechanics using Modcarts, devices hacked together by tech-savvy fans. Discover clever combinations of mods in order to  progress and even break level design in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/forum.gif?t=1742402278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Immerse in a new and peculiar fandom</u></strong> through browsing an online forum. Check back as you play to find a community growing in real-time, where you can browse discussion threads for game tips, hints, rumors, theories, and arguments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/shop.gif?t=1742402278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Collect rare promotional merchandise</strong></u> from online resellers. Decorate your room by spending coins you collect throughout the game's levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7+ Modcart abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9+ levels planned with unique themes and obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LOTS of merchandise to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully live-recorded acoustic soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fullscreen view toggle on CRT and laptop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller and Steam Deck support is planned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/wishlist_now.gif?t=1742402278\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Development History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prototype version was original developed in one week for Vinesauce's Shroomjam 2024 by a team of two young game developers from Oregon and Michigan. After seeing how much the original game resonated with folks, we decided to keep going and make it a full game! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589190?t=1742402278","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/2d5120e95e24e26750654e7e9f5d2592b18bd221/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742402278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/21362237e8fa023906b44fb9fdd935364ba12597/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742402278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/21362237e8fa023906b44fb9fdd935364ba12597/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742402278","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is COCOBOY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>In an alternate history 2005</strong></u>, the forgotten 80's platformer COCOBOY has re-entered the public consciousness of a niche few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/hack.gif?t=1742402278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Modify, brute force, and restore</u></strong> unused game mechanics using Modcarts, devices hacked together by tech-savvy fans. Discover clever combinations of mods in order to  progress and even break level design in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/forum.gif?t=1742402278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Immerse in a new and peculiar fandom</u></strong> through browsing an online forum. Check back as you play to find a community growing in real-time, where you can browse discussion threads for game tips, hints, rumors, theories, and arguments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/shop.gif?t=1742402278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Collect rare promotional merchandise</strong></u> from online resellers. Decorate your room by spending coins you collect throughout the game's levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7+ Modcart abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9+ levels planned with unique themes and obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LOTS of merchandise to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully live-recorded acoustic soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fullscreen view toggle on CRT and laptop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller and Steam Deck support is planned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/wishlist_now.gif?t=1742402278\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Development History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prototype version was original developed in one week for Vinesauce's Shroomjam 2024 by a team of two young game developers from Oregon and Michigan. After seeing how much the original game resonated with folks, we decided to keep going and make it a full game! </p>","developers":["Adrian Kellman","Cameron Werner"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/992f422dd241df28828e075e9d68a57476168d1c/header.jpg?t=1742402278","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115677,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115677/movie480.mp4?t=1742402277","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115677/movie_max.mp4?t=1742402277"},"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115677/a037d54e3a51df5c8d396e5049f8aae8beb8333c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742402277","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115677/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742402277","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115677/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742402277"}}],"name":"COCOBOY","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["cocoteam"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l